{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/dq1d9i","slideIndex":7,"text":"The five acceptance scenarios were run using node site/acceptance-tests.mjs; all five passed. These are response-safety checks of deterministic preview logic, not a model accuracy benchmark or live browser test. JavaScript syntax checks passed. The local Node server is configured to use the OpenAI Responses API with store:false when OPENAI_API_KEY is set, but no key is present in the current environment. Do not put a key in frontend code or the repository. Full assessment rubric and external user testing remain outstanding."}